  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyakoyu habuliluwu mwanta walukanu mumpata yaIsarela hadiŋi kaLevi wumu washakama ishinadi di kwawu detuŋa daEfweremi damapidi, wakwatili ntombu yindi wamumbanda kuBetelemi Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenowu ntombu yindi wamushiyili nakuya nakwila wuvumbi, hakufumakudi yena hakufunta kwitala datata yindi kuBetelemi Yuda, washakaminukutukweji tuwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nfumwindi wanyamukili wamulondeli kulonda ahoshinindi chakumukokweja, amuleti cheŋi. Wasendeli niŋamba yindi niyimbuluyiyedi. Yena mumbanda wamwiŋijili li mwitala datata yindi. Tata yanowuchaŋa dima chamumweniyi owu iyala watiyili kuwaha kudi mona nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muku windi, tata yanowu chaŋadima, wamukakeleli, washakamini nindi, mafuku asatu. Adiili, anwini, ashakamini kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifuku damu chiwanawa hindukili budidi yayeni, yonyamuka nikunyamuka nindi ayaŋa. Tata yanowu chaŋadima wamwilili muku windi nindi, Dyakuku kachibalu kadinkendi wutiyi Ŋovu; neyi wunadyi dehi, himukuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu ashakamini, adiili, anwini, wejima wawu mwayedi wawu hamu. Tata yanowuchaŋa dima hakumwila iyala, nindi, Itejaku tuhu mwani, wukami nilelu, wutiyi kuwaha kumuchima weyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyala wanyamukili nindi ayaŋa, mukuwindi wamukanjikŋili, wakamini cheŋi kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hefuku damu chitanuwa hindukili budidi nankashi nindi ayaŋa. Tata yanowu chaŋadima nindi, Wundishaku muchima weyi mwivumu mwani, hembelaku kwili melela. Nochu adiili, anwini, wejima wawu mwayedi wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chanyamukiliyi owu iyala, niyena nintombu yindi niŋamba yindi, muku windi, tata yanowuchaŋa dima, hakumwila nindi, Tala ntahi itena daya dehi mwani, kuminadakukama mwani. Tala ntahi itena hidikuya nakuholoka; kamaku kunukulonda wutiyi kuwaha kumuchima weyi. Kumadiki mwakanyamukabudidi mwakaya kwenu, kulonda mwakafunti cheŋi kumukala wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa owu iyala kwonti kwindi kukama cheŋi, wanyamukili kwindihakuya. Washi kili kwakwihi naYebusi, yowu Yerusalema. Wadiŋi nayimbuluyindi yiyedi yakukasila masadi akushakama. Nintombu yindiwadiŋi nindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chashikiluwu kwakwihi naYebusi kwela dehi melela aweni. Ŋamba hakumwila mwanta windi, nindi, Tuyenu mwani, twambukimunjila, tuyi kumukalowu wawaYebusi, tukamuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchinka mwanta windi nindi, Hitukwambuka munjila nakuya hamukala wanawa antu acheŋuku, ochu hiyanyana kaIsarela wanyi! Tukupandakana kwetu nakuya kuGibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamwilili ŋamba yindi nindi, Tuyi tukabili kushika kwakwihinanyikaloyu, twakakami hela kuGibeya, hela tuhu kuRama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu apandakeni, hiyakuyaŋa munjila yawu. Itena dayiholokeleli kwakwihina kuGibeya waBenjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aambukili munjila, hiyakuya haGibeya akakamuhu. Wayili hamukala, washakamini hanzi. Kwosi muntu wamulejeliitala dakukamaku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi halehi, kutala ipala deyala hakufuma kunyidimu yindi kumahahamelela. Yenowu iyala wadiŋi wakwituŋa daEfweremi damapidi, kuGibeya washakaminuku tuhu chakushakama. Ilaŋa ntu ahamukala wuna adiŋi akwaBenjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wafumbwili mesu indi, wamweni ŋeji weyala nashakami hanzi hamukala. Kutiya owu ipala nindi, Indi eyiwunafumi kudihi? Wukuya kudihi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuchinka iyala nindi, Twendatufuma kuBetelemi Yuda, hitukuya kumbadi hana yina yetuŋa dakuEfweremi damapidi, muloŋa diku nafuma. Nayili kuBetelemi Yuda. Ichi dinu hinukuya kwitala daYehova. Kwosi muntu nanleji itala dinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matahu etu ayimbulu yetu tudi nawu nikudya kwawu. Nikudya nivinyutudi nayu, niyami niyakambuŋeyi wamumbanda, niyamukwenzi iwu tudinindi etu ambuŋeyi. Kwosi chuma chitunabuluku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutiya owu ipalanindi, Kolenu ntahi; neyi hadi yiwunabuli nukukukeŋela. Chinjila enukukama hanzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu wamwiŋijili mwitala dindi, wayidiishili yimbulu. Aweleli kunyendu yawu, adiili, anwini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chashakaminuwu nakutiya kuwaha munyichima yawu, amayala amakwawu ahamukala adiŋi antu amukunkulwayi enjili kwitala niniku, niniku, hiyakweta nihachenzelu. Hiyakumwila owu ipala mwini itala dindi, nawu, Mwidishi owu iyala weŋila mwitala deyi kulonda tumwiluki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yenowu iyala mwini itala dindi wedi kili hanzi nakuhosha nawu, nindi, Chinjila, enu ana kwami, bayi mwila chatama chochichuku, mwani. Iwuiyala hiŋeji yami, bayi mwila wusupi iwuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tala mwanami wamujiki, nintombu yindi owu. Nukuyiidishilawu muyisawuli kwenu, muyikoŋikwenu mwejima mumwamona kuwaha. Hakwila yeniwu iyala bayi mumwila wusupi watoha chi kuma hanichuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa amayala kwontikwawu kutiya mwizu dindi, dichi owu iyala wakwatili ntombu yindi, wayiidishililiyi. Amwilukili, achiishili wufuku wejima nakumutamisha hohu. Chikwasambishili kucha amúumbaku ni kumuumbaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hankunku yakucha mumbanda wenjili nakudimbukila kuchisu chetala danowu iyala kwakama mwanta windi, nichikunachi to-o.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanta windi wahindukili budidi, wenzulwili yenzelu yetala, wedikilihanzi nindi ayaŋa. Kutala chaŋadima, ntombu yindi, nadimbukili dehi kwiluŋa dachisu chetala, nimakasindi muchisu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 19:28"
          },
