              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu ochu, antu ejima achimweni hiyakuhosha nawu, Kanda tumonaŋahu dehi kukoŋa chumichi; saŋa afuminuwu anyana kaIsarela mwituŋa daEjipitu kushika nikwitaŋwa dalelu dinu, chinjila! Toŋojokenu chachiwahi, kwatenu mpùŋa muhoshi.",
          "type": "text",
